      "prop": "padding",
      "why": "`loader` counts as 'anywhere' only because it is an icon name in icons.js; the icon's <svg> carries `lucide lucide-loader`, and no element is both .empty-state (UI.emptyState's <div>) and .loader (UI.loader's <div>)"
    }
